Upstream: https://github.com/kmackay/micro-ecc
Commit: 541b3a78026420a3e369c4c9281c396b5e531113
License: BSD-2-Clause (see LICENSE.txt)

The vendored files are the upstream sources needed to build the library.
The only source modification is the configuration block at the top of uECC.c,
which selects portable 32-bit code, enables upstream optimization level 2 fast
modular reduction, explicitly disables the ARM assembly reduction hook, and
disables every curve except secp256r1.
